# Normalize to LF in the repository. The CSV writer opens files in binary mode
# and emits '\n' explicitly, and test_csv.cpp asserts that byte-for-byte, so
# letting autocrlf rewrite line endings would make source and tests disagree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.gif  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.csv  -text
